 "words": 208,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "Eighteen years old when he sat the throne",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 1.76,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Reigned in Jerusalem for just three months",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.44,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "His mother Nehushta from the city gates",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 1.66,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "He did evil in the Lord's own sight",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.83,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Nebuchadnezzar marched against the city wall",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 1.44,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Officers laid siege to hold the land tight",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.59,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The king of Babylon came to press the siege",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 2.15,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Jehoiachin surrendered with his mother there",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.56,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Taken to Babylon with the gold",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.56,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Ten thousand captives left the city old",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.99,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Treasures stripped from Solomon's house of God",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 1.69,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Recorded as childless by the word of God",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.06,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Thirty-seven years in prison dark",
   "heard": 3,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.89,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Evil-merodach spoke to him with care",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 1.42,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "A seat of honor among kings in Babylon",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 2.33,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "He ate at the king's table each day",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.59,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Taken to Babylon with the gold",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.48,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Ten thousand captives left the city old",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.46,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Treasures stripped from Solomon's house of God",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.95,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Recorded as childless by the word of God",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.17,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Yet in Matthew's genealogy he appears",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.16,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Jechoniah father of Shealtiel there",
   "heard": 2,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.48,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "A line of descendants through the exile long",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.46,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "God's covenant holds firm and endures strong",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.38,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
